## Why This Is Asked
Design a scalable, auditable CDC ingestion that evolves schemas safely while preserving privacy and lineage.

## Key Concepts
- Central schema registry with versioned contracts
- Idempotent upserts and MERGE semantics
- Dynamic schema evolution and tenant isolation
- Late data buffering and privacy-preserving BI views
- End-to-end testing and monitoring of contracts and lineage

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: contract validation and upsert
function upsertEvent(event, registry) {
  const contract = registry.getContract(event.version, event.schemaKey);
  if (!contract.validate(event)) throw new Error('Contract violation');
  // perform idempotent merge into Iceberg
  mergeIntoIceberg(event, contract.primaryKey);
}
```

